## 6. Constants (v2Phase1MVP defaults)

```sql
-- Constants used in early logic:
GCTL_INITIAL_PRICE_USDC = 0.75
CARBON_CREDIT_PRICE_USDC = 10.00
REGION_ACTIVATION_MIN_FARMS = 3
REGION_ACTIVATION_GCTL_THRESHOLD = [to be set by Foundation], 
  // Initially this will be as below
  if REGION_IN_US: REGION_ACTIVATION_GCTL_THRESHOLD = 20,000
  else: REGION_ACTIVATION_GCTL_THRESHOLD = 200,000

-- PD Auction constants
PD_AUCTION_INITIAL_SPLIT = 0.5  -- 50% initial split
PD_AUCTION_WEEKLY_DECAY = 0.05  -- 5% weekly decay
PD_AUCTION_MIN_SPLIT = 0.02     -- 2% minimum split for farm owner
PD_AUCTION_COMMUNITY_NODE_WEEKS = 12  -- 12 weeks to community node

-- Asset competition pool constants
SUPPORTED_PD_CURRENCIES = ['USDG', 'GCTL', 'GLW']  

-- GCTL Airdrop constants
GCTL_AIRDROP_RATIO = 3  -- 1:3 ratio (impact power to GCTL)
GCTL_SHADOW_STAKE_REGION = 'CGP'  -- default region for shadow staking

-- GCTL Staking constants
GCTL_DEFAULT_UNSTAKE_PERIOD_WEEKS = 100  -- default unstake period for regions
GCTL_WEEKLY_DRIP_PERCENTAGE = 1/GCTL_DEFAULT_UNSTAKE_PERIOD_WEEKS  -- 1% per week (for 100-week default period)
```